{"date": "2021-07-23", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0723.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:47:21+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "f086b4d98cfeec3f86f48810bb591ee85548a29b3579cc788522b1317d3250f0", "image_bytes": 154041, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Sun, 18 Jul 2021 23:51:59 GMT", "title": "忌比赛第一", "title_kind": "忌", "source": "悉尼", "author": "村上春树", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "在人生中，重要的事情不是胜利，而是奋争。对人生来说必不可缺的东西，不是取胜，而是曾经无悔地战斗过。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1, "author_foreign_name": "MurakamiHaruki"}
{"date": "2021-07-24", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0724.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:47:21+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "125992069239a5f18e07515da2e4de847332c38e0d4e92b2f03b59a675378987", "image_bytes": 145740, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Sun, 18 Jul 2021 23:52:00 GMT", "title": "宜吸猫", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "细雪", "author": "谷崎润一郎", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "雪子正在用面颊去亲小猫，每一低头便露出脖颈，看不到她脸上的表情，但完全能看出她的心事。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "TanizakiJunichiro"}
{"date": "2021-07-25", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0725.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:47:21+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "05d03d2521585e2427e5e4dba5b7f2c07fa15f3576691970d96782f2beac687d", "image_bytes": 135912, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Sun, 18 Jul 2021 23:52:01 GMT", "title": "宜嗜睡", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "九故事", "author": "杰罗姆·大卫·塞林格", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "一个人只要还能真正感到睡意，那他就总有希望再次成为一个完—好—无—缺—的人。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "Jerome David Salinger"}
