{"date": "2021-07-29", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2021/0729.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:47:22+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "c87634ad7e6dc588814f2e332e9e071c3241c817cdac4ccc687acffad5ccbb56", "image_bytes": 143877, "image_format": "jpeg", "last_modified": "Mon, 26 Jul 2021 00:00:55 GMT", "title": "宜密室逃脱", "title_kind": "宜", "source": "在一间屋子墙壁的近旁", "author": "耶胡达-阿米亥", "author_roles": ["诗人"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": [], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "爱并非最后一个房间：还有其他的房间紧随其后，那没有尽头的整整一个走廊。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "author_foreign_name": "Yehuda Amichai"}
